<P>(<I>d</I>) For tanks and storage vessels designed for pressure over 1 p.s.i.g., the total rate of venting shall be determined in accordance with Table H-10, except that when the exposed wetted area of the surface is greater than 2,800 square feet, the total rate of venting shall be calculated by the following formula:</P>
<FP-2>CFH = 1,107A
<SU>0.82</SU>
</FP-2>
