<NOTE>
<HED>Note:</HED>
<P>The foregoing formula is based on <I>Q = 21,000A</I>
<SU>0.82</SU>.</P></NOTE>
<P>(<I>e</I>) The total emergency relief venting capacity for any specific stable liquid may be determined by the following formula:</P>
<FP-2>V = 1337 &#xF7; <I>L&#x221A;M</I>
</FP-2>
<EXTRACT>
