<P>C. <I>Voltages of 72.6 to 800 kilovolts.</I> For voltages of 72.6 kilovolts to 800 kilovolts, this section bases the electrical component of minimum approach distances, before the application of any altitude correction factor, on the following formula:</P>
<HD1>Equation 1&#x2014;For Voltages of 72.6 kV to 800 kV
</HD1>
<FP-2><I>D</I> = 0.3048(<I>C</I> + <I>a</I>) <I>V</I><E T="54">L</E>-<E T="54">G</E><I>T</I>
