<SU>12</SU>
<FTREF/> in the equation in Table R-3 to obtain the minimum approach distance. If the worksite is no more than 900 meters (3,000 feet) above sea level, the employer may use this value of <I>T</I> to determine the minimum approach distance from Table 14 through Table 21.</P>
