</TD></TR><TR><TD colspan="4">&#x2020; The arc rating must be a minimum of 4 cal/cm<sup>2</sup> less than the estimated incident energy. Note that &#xA7; 1910.269(l)(8)(v)(E) permits this type of head and face protection, with a minimum arc rating of 4 cal/cm<sup>2</sup> less than the estimated incident energy, at any incident energy level.
</TD></TR><TR><TD colspan="4">&#x2021; Note that &#xA7; 1910.269(l)(8)(v) permits this type of head and face protection at any incident energy level.</TD></TR></TFOOT></TABLE>
