<HED>Note:</HED>
<P>The following appendices to &#xA7; 1910.272 serve as nonmandatory guidelines to assist employers and employees in complying with the requirements of this section, as well as to provide other helpful information.</P>
<P>No additional burdens are imposed through these appendices.</P></NOTE>
