<P>(c) <I>Applicability of requirements for disconnecting means.</I> The requirement in &#xA7; 1910.147(c)(2)(iii) that energy isolating devices be capable of accepting a lockout device whenever replacement or major repair, renovation or modification of a machine or equipment is performed, and whenever new machines or equipment are installed after January 2, 1990, applies in addition to any requirements in &#xA7;&#xA7; 1910.303 through 1910.308 that disconnecting means be capable of being locked in the open position under certain conditions.</P>
