<P>(viii) Monitoring of the breathing-gas temperature at the rebreather mouthpiece (at the &#x201C;chrome T&#x201D; connector), and ensuring that this temperature conforms to the temperature of a diver's exhaled breath at the water temperature and ventilation rate used during the testing trial;
