</FP-1>
<FP-1>HIGHLY FLAMMABLE LIQUID AND VAPOR
</FP-1>
<FP-1>DO NOT SMOKE
</FP-1>
<FP-1>WEAR RESPIRATORY PROTECTION IN THIS AREA
</FP-1>
<FP-1>AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY</FP-1></EXTRACT>
<P>(ii) Prior to June 1, 2016, employers may use the following legend in lieu of that specified in paragraph (j)(2)(i) of this section:</P>
<EXTRACT>
<FP-1>DANGER
</FP-1>
<FP-1>BENZENE
</FP-1>
