</FP-1>
<FP-1>WEAR RESPIRATORY PROTECTION IN THIS AREA
</FP-1>
<FP-1>AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY</FP-1></EXTRACT>
<P>(ii) Prior to June 1, 2016, employers may use the following legend in lieu of that specified in paragraph (o)(2) of this section:</P>
